From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlmarionAI <150292831+AlmarionAI@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 10:26:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [budget] share write budget across nested statement execution

Keep cumulative write accounting on the outer executing portal, share it across nested SPI and SQL executors, and retain it across suspended protocol execution. Restore the dynamic scope on all portal error paths. A sticky exceeded limit prevents exception handlers from committing earlier writes after catching SQLSTATE 53400. Preserve the existing ModifyTable input-row charge point, including trigger bookkeeping, and executor-local accounting for portal-less internal work.
